{"unit_id":"FeatherHunter__dsh-mattpocock-skills-deck#readme-8","repo":"FeatherHunter/dsh-mattpocock-skills-deck","commit":"a81af8bce15d6130d1a1b554f87d2e6059aafaf1","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mattpocock-skills-deck README · 或者：dsh plugin --profile desktop add dsh-mattpocock-skills-deck@1.9.0-beta.34 --registry https://registry.npmjs.org\n```\n\n> **用 GitHub 后端前的权限前提**：插件替你改 ISSUE，用的是本机 `gh` 已登录账号的权限——建标签、改票需要仓库的 `push` 权限；改指派、流转标签需要 `triage` 权限。账号在该仓库只有 `只读` 权限时，插件会把仓库如实标成只读：改票、打标签与标签流转不可用，浏览与刷新照常。\n\n<h2 align=\"center\"><sub>BOARD</sub><br>任务板</h2>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\nDSH侧边栏-总览任务面板全貌。通过插件内置SKILLS的任务拆分，可以做到session并发处理。效率加倍省心。","source":"extracted","section":"或者"}
